  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed balcony and rear windows/doors, by virtue of their excessive size, scale, and inappropriate position and design, would harm neighbours' living conditions at 62 Parkwood Road, in terms of loss of privacy and increased noise and disturbance, contrary to the Part A5 of the Hounslow Character, Sustainability and Design Codes SPD, and Local Plan Policies CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture) and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations), and the principles of the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed front extension, by reason of its inappropriate size and design, would result in a bulky and incongruous addition to the site, unbalancing the appearance and symmetry of the pair of semi-detached houses, harmful to the character and appearance of the site and surrounding area, contrary to Part A5 of the Hounslow Character, Sustainability and Design Codes SPD and Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations)."
  ],
